      "y": 324,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 134,
      "text": "branch: main  →  namespace: public\n──────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nArgo CD Application: public-web, public-api, portal\nDomain: app · api · portal .company.com  (Public Internet)\nselfHeal: true  — production-grade enforcement\nauto sync: true  |  prune: true",
