      "y": 555,
      "width": 1760,
      "height": 20,
      "text": "GitOps repo structure:  infra-gitops/  →  environments/{dev|uat|public}/{app}/  →  Helm values or Kustomize overlays  →  Argo CD Application CRD points here",
